The Red Pen — LinkedIn Roast & Rebuild
Day 44/60 — #60DaysOfClaudeAI
An AI-powered LinkedIn profile reviewer that roasts your profile like a brutally honest ex-recruiter, rewrites every section, and hands you a 7-day activation plan to make it actually work.
What it does
Collects your profile — headline, About section, most recent experience, top skills, and target goal (job, clients, thought leadership, or network growth). If you don't have a LinkedIn yet, it asks 5 alternate questions to build one from scratch.
The Roast — scores every section out of 10 (Headline, About hook, full About, Experience, Skills/Keywords), explains the recruiter's real 3-second reaction, why it hurts, and the invisible cost of leaving it as-is. Overall score out of 100.
The Rebuild — 3 headline options (keyword-optimized, value-proposition, authority), a fully rewritten About section with embedded SEO keywords, before/after experience bullets, and a skills add/remove/pin list.
Before vs After Scorecard — every section scored side by side with the delta.
7-Day Activation Plan — day-by-day actions including two ready-to-post LinkedIn drafts, a connection request template, and the "Value Comment" formula (Agree + Add Insight + Ask a Question).
Shareable Summary Card — a screenshot-ready before/after card for your own LinkedIn post.
How it works
Single-file HTML app with zero dependencies. On submit, it makes a live call to the Claude API (Sonnet 4.6), which generates the entire roast, rebuild, and plan as structured JSON based only on the information provided — nothing is hardcoded or fabricated.
Tech
Vanilla HTML/CSS/JavaScript, no build step, no libraries
Anthropic Messages API (claude-sonnet-4-6)
Fully responsive, works on mobile
Try it
Open linkedin-roast.html in any browser. Toggle between "I have a LinkedIn" / "I don't have one yet," fill in your details (or hit "Fill demo data" to see it in action), and submit.
